{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43626","headline":"与李司直令从荻塘联句 · 清昼","name":"与李司直令从荻塘联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"画舸悠悠荻塘路，真僧与我相随去。\n寒花似菊不知名，霜叶如枫是何树。\n倦客经秋夜共归，情多语尽明相顾。\n遥城候骑来仍少，傍岭哀猨发无数。\n心闲清净得禅寂，兴逸纵横问章句。\n虫声切切草间悲，萤影纷纷月前度。\n撩乱云峰好赋诗，婵娟水月堪爲喻。\n与君出处本不同，从此还依旧山住。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}